concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-1-sec-7b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7B Section 23YUA (definition of corresponding law)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7b ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: corresponding law means a law that:  (a) relates to the carrying out of forensic procedures and DNA databases; and  (b) either:  (i) substantially corresponds to this Part; or  (ii) is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this definition." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: corresponding law means a law that:  (a) relates to the carrying out of forensic procedures and DNA databases; and  (b) either:  (i) substantially corresponds to this Part; or  (ii) is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this definition."@en ;
