concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-1-sec-7f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7F Transitional provision for existing arrangements under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7f ;
    values:originalText "subsection 23YUD(1) An arrangement that:  (a) was entered into under subsection 23YUD(1) of the Crimes Act 1914 before the commencement of this item; and  (b) was in force immediately before this commencement; continues in force after that commencement as if it had been entered into under that subsection as amended by this Schedule.  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 1 Technical corrections of sentencing and parole provisions  Part 4  Crimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 11" ;
    skos:definition "subsection 23YUD(1) An arrangement that:  (a) was entered into under subsection 23YUD(1) of the Crimes Act 1914 before the commencement of this item; and  (b) was in force immediately before this commencement; continues in force after that commencement as if it had been entered into under that subsection as amended by this Schedule.  Amendment of the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 1 Technical corrections of sentencing and parole provisions  Part 4  Crimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 11"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fed91bdaab372f391b03a14df82275fe4af0ac16933310d376a8cc9795a14c9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Continues existing arrangements under subsection 23YUD(1) of the Crimes Act 1914 as amended by this Schedule." ;
