concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-2-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 12 applies in relation to the escape of a person after the commencement of this item, whether or not the person was in custody from before that commencement or was arrested before that commencement. Law and Justice Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 1994" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment made by item 12 applies in relation to the escape of a person after the commencement of this item, whether or not the person was in custody from before that commencement or was arrested before that commencement. Law and Justice Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 1994"@en ;
