concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-2-sec-20-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Crimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20-2 ;
    values:originalText "authority includes a body or person that:  (a) under a law of a State, may issue a warrant for the arrest and return to custody or detention of a person, following the revocation or cancellation of:  (i) a parole order; or  (ii) an order for conditional release; or  (iii) an order for home detention; or  (iv) an order for periodic detention; or  (v) any other order for the release of a person from custody; or  (vi) any other order of a kind prescribed by the regulations; and  (b) is prescribed by the regulations. tribunal does not include a body or person of a kind referred to in the definition of authority in this section. warrant includes a warrant issued by a body or person that is an authority for the purposes of this Part.  Technical corrections relating to Part numbering in the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3 Corrections relating to Part 1AA of the Crimes Act 1914  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 21" ;
    skos:definition "authority includes a body or person that:  (a) under a law of a State, may issue a warrant for the arrest and return to custody or detention of a person, following the revocation or cancellation of:  (i) a parole order; or  (ii) an order for conditional release; or  (iii) an order for home detention; or  (iv) an order for periodic detention; or  (v) any other order for the release of a person from custody; or  (vi) any other order of a kind prescribed by the regulations; and  (b) is prescribed by the regulations. tribunal does not include a body or person of a kind referred to in the definition of authority in this section. warrant includes a warrant issued by a body or person that is an authority for the purposes of this Part.  Technical corrections relating to Part numbering in the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3 Corrections relating to Part 1AA of the Crimes Act 1914  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 21"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2dd227c5481d73bfaa59a8eef9d8f12f916061339d78c078b6d3da8e7589b801" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authority includes bodies or persons that may issue warrants for arrest and return to custody." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.24" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-2-sec-20-2-norm .
