concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-3-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 Saving provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Schedule do not invalidate:  (a) an instrument made under, or referring to, a Part of the Crimes Act 1914 whose heading is repealed and substituted by this Schedule; or  (b) anything done under such an instrument or such a Part. (2) Subitem (1) has effect whether the instrument was made, or the thing was done, before or after this Act received the Royal Assent." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Schedule do not invalidate:  (a) an instrument made under, or referring to, a Part of the Crimes Act 1914 whose heading is repealed and substituted by this Schedule; or  (b) anything done under such an instrument or such a Part. (2) Subitem (1) has effect whether the instrument was made, or the thing was done, before or after this Act received the Royal Assent."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1d27a191ace8572a10875b59e723cd18c664b9e996bfd14f4be3e2e4350c4b49" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments do not invalidate certain instruments or actions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
